WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:00.958
Sorry, excuse me.

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.417
Sorry. Sorry, ma'am.
Sorry, excuse me.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.333
Sorry. Ooh! Excuse me.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:08.292
There is the ogre
of Dubrovnik!

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.042
Ogre! Ogre!

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:12.208
Please accept
my net of regrets!

00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:13.833
Here is my net.

00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:23.208
No, no, no.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.875
I've got this one, laddie.

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:34.583
I'm the real ogre
of Dubrovnik.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.250
Now get out of my swamp!

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:40.875
And stay down!

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.417
-Thanks, Shrek.
-You're welcome, laddie.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.000
Ogre! Ogre!

